Exceptions

The MIT License above covers the source code, configuration, and
documentation in this repository. It does not cover the following, which
remain the property of Randonneurs Ontario or their respective owners and
may not be reused without permission:

- Club logos, branding, and the stamp artwork (public/logo*, public/stamp-*)
- Photographs and images (public/hero-images, public/hero-carousel,
  public/og-*, public/awards, and other image files under public/)
- Newsletters, guides, and policy documents (public/newsletters,
  public/guides, public/policies)
- Seed data and member or ride records (supabase/seed*.sql)

Other randonneuring clubs are welcome to reuse the code. Please replace the
branding and content with your own.
